---
title: TDD Workflow Phases
---
flowchart LR
    A["📋 Phase 1:<br/>Skeleton"] --> B["🧪 Phase 2:<br/>Tests"]
    B --> C["💻 Phase 3:<br/>Implementation"]
    C --> D["✅ Phase 4:<br/>Validation"]
    D --> E["🔧 Phase 5:<br/>Refinement"]
    E --> F["🎯 Complete"]
    
    A --> A1["📁 Create module files<br/>📝 Add type stubs<br/>📋 Define interfaces"]
    B --> B1["❌ Write failing tests<br/>🧪 Cover all cases<br/>📊 Track coverage"]
    C --> C1["💡 Implement methods<br/>✍️ Add docstrings<br/>⚠️ Handle errors"]
    D --> D1["✅ Run test suite<br/>📈 Verify coverage<br/>🔍 Check compliance"]
    E --> E1["🔄 Remove duplication<br/>📚 Improve docs<br/>⚡ Optimize code"]
    F --> F1["📦 Ready for review<br/>🎉 Feature complete<br/>🚀 Ready to merge"]
    
    B1 -.->|Tests fail| C
    D1 -.->|Coverage < 80%| B
    D1 -.->|Tests fail| C
    E1 -.->|Issues found| C
    
    style A fill:#e3f2fd
    style B fill:#fff3e0
    style C fill:#f3e5f5
    style D fill:#e8f5e9
    style E fill:#fce4ec
    style F fill:#c8e6c9
    
    style A1 fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2
    style B1 fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00
    style C1 fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2
    style D1 fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c
    style E1 fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b
    style F1 fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
